      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Query: Next.js authenticates (Clerk), resolves the workspace, mints a 60 s token and calls POST /api/py/retrieve. Python runs one REPEATABLE READ\ntransaction: dense + lexical search, RRF (k=60), Voyage rerank, dedup, parent expansion, 6,000-token packing, answerability gate, [E#] evidence bundle.\nIngest: upload to Blob, then leased resumable steps PARSE, OCR, CHUNK, EMBED, ACTIVATE, driven by a self-firing tick route (Cron is the daily safety net).\nDashed arrows: optional or outside the request path. Razorpay is off unless FEATURE_BILLING_ENABLED; Supermemory applies to the legacy engine only.\nscribe-eval / scribe-perf and the CI retrieval gate run locally or in GitHub Actions, never on Vercel, against a separate database and the same providers.",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Query: Next.js authenticates (Clerk), resolves the workspace, mints a 60 s token and calls POST /api/py/retrieve. Python runs one REPEATABLE READ\ntransaction: dense + lexical search, RRF (k=60), Voyage rerank, dedup, parent expansion, 6,000-token packing, answerability gate, [E#] evidence bundle.\nIngest: upload to Blob, then leased resumable steps PARSE, OCR, CHUNK, EMBED, ACTIVATE, driven by a self-firing tick route (Cron is the daily safety net).\nDashed arrows: optional or outside the request path. Razorpay is off unless FEATURE_BILLING_ENABLED; Supermemory applies to the legacy engine only.\nscribe-eval / scribe-perf and the CI retrieval gate run locally or in GitHub Actions, never on Vercel, against a separate database and the same providers.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
